<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-D JULY NET RISES TO PLN 2.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-D JULY NET RISES TO PLN 2.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.69 vs   2.51</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.39 vs   4.87</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.05 vs   5.01</p>
<p> Sales		   19.09 vs  17.45</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    11.22 vs   7.41</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	16.97 vs  15.47</p>
<p> Operating profit    15.63 vs  16.78</p>
<p> Sales		   94.56 vs  84.97</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paint maker is Polifarb Debica</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
